OL,3,GNEWSADrama about paedophile head
OL,4,Ateacher cancelled by S4C
OL,5,
OL,6,FWelsh-language broadcaster S4C has
OL,7,Fcancelled a planned three-part drama
OL,8,Fabout a paedophile head teacher after
OL,9,Fdeciding that proceeding with the
OL,10,Fprogramme would "not be appropriate".
OL,12,FNeil Foden, the former head of Ysgol
OL,13,FFriars in Bangor, was jailed for 17
OL,14,Fyears in 2024 after being found guilty
OL,15,Fof 19 charges involving four girls.
OL,17,FThe drama, titled Y Pennaeth (The Head
OL,18,FTeacher) was set to be broadcast in
OL,19,F2027 with actor Mark Lewis Jones to
OL,20,Fportray Foden.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
